### 1. New conversation start
POST http://localhost:3000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"prompt": "Bolí ma hlava už tri dni. Najdi mi lekara. Nepytaj dalsie otazky"}

> {% client.global.set("streamId", response.body.streamId); client.global.set("sessionId", response.body.sessionId); %}

### - 2. Run after first post
GET http://localhost:3000/chat/stream/{{streamId}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### 3. Next post in the sequence
POST http://localhost:3000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"prompt": "A mám aj teplotu", "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}"}

> {% client.global.set("streamId", response.body.streamId); %}


### 2.1 Run after first post
GET http://localhost:3000/chat/history/{{sessionId}}


### 3. Next post in the sequence
POST http://localhost:3000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"prompt": "Ano, asi 38.5", "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}"}

